# Dependencies (forge-std, OpenZeppelin) are installed with:
#   forge install foundry-rs/forge-std OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts
# (OpenZeppelin is pinned to v5.7.0 in foundry.lock.)
# This file intentionally lists no submodules: the snapshot used to
# publish this repository cannot create submodule links, and listing
# them here without links breaks `forge install`.
